---
// CareerTimeline.astro - Operational Progression Matrix with technical nameplate headers
---

<div class="space-y-6">
  
  <!-- PHASE 04: Huawei Digital Power (Sept 2026–present) -->
  <article class="rounded-lg border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark-card overflow-hidden transition-colors hover:border-accent-dark/50 dark:hover:border-accent/40">
    <!-- Nameplate Top Bar -->
    <div class="px-5 sm:px-7 py-3.5 bg-surface-light-muted/70 dark:bg-surface-dark-elevated/80 border-b border-border-light dark:border-border-dark flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-accent/15 border border-accent-dark/30 dark:border-accent/30 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-accent-dark dark:text-accent">
          PHASE 04 · ACTIVE
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Sept 2026 — Present
        </span>
        <span class="opacity-30 font-mono hidden sm:inline">//</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Executive Solutions Sales Manager — Utility PV &amp; BESS
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <img 
          src="/logos/huawei-digital-power.svg" 
          alt="Huawei Digital Power" 
          class="h-7 sm:h-8 w-auto max-w-[165px] object-contain block dark:brightness-110" 
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Body & Technical Spec Footer -->
    <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-4xl">
        Leading technical sales, pre-sales architecture, and solution design for utility-scale solar PV and battery energy storage infrastructure at <strong>Huawei Digital Power</strong>—bridging power electronics, grid-forming/grid-following architectures, and field engineering reality with commercial strategy across Mexico and LATAM.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-border-light/60 dark:border-border-dark/60 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Utility-Scale PV &amp; BESS</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Pre-Sales Architecture</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Grid Integration</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">SCOPE: MEXICO &amp; LATAM</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- PHASE 03: LATNOVVA (Oct 2025–Aug 2026) -->
  <article class="rounded-lg border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark-card overflow-hidden transition-colors hover:border-accent-dark/50 dark:hover:border-accent/40">
    <div class="px-5 sm:px-7 py-3.5 bg-surface-light-muted/70 dark:bg-surface-dark-elevated/80 border-b border-border-light dark:border-border-dark flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark font-mono text-xs font-medium text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">
          PHASE 03
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Oct 2025 — Aug 2026
        </span>
        <span class="opacity-30 font-mono hidden sm:inline">//</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Technical Operations &amp; Advisory
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <img 
          src="/logos/latnovva.png" 
          alt="LATNOVVA" 
          class="h-6 sm:h-7 w-auto max-w-[140px] object-contain block dark:brightness-110" 
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-4xl">
        Strategic technical advisory and field operations across utility-scale Solar PV and BESS. Bridged engineering design, EPC execution, and long-term asset reliability—while designing and deploying custom digital field-operations workflows for attendance validation and multi-site crew dispatch.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-border-light/60 dark:border-border-dark/60 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Technical Operations</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">EPC &amp; Owner Advisory</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Operational Tooling</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/work/latnovva-digital-tools" class="text-accent-dark dark:text-accent hover:underline font-medium">
          View LATNOVVA Case Study →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- PHASE 02: Sungrow Power (2020–2025) -->
  <article class="rounded-lg border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark-card overflow-hidden transition-colors hover:border-accent-dark/50 dark:hover:border-accent/40">
    <div class="px-5 sm:px-7 py-3.5 bg-surface-light-muted/70 dark:bg-surface-dark-elevated/80 border-b border-border-light dark:border-border-dark flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark font-mono text-xs font-medium text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">
          PHASE 02
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          2020 — 2025
        </span>
        <span class="opacity-30 font-mono hidden sm:inline">//</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Field Commissioning → Regional Service Lead → LATAM Center of Expertise (CoE)
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <img 
          src="/logos/sungrow.png" 
          alt="Sungrow Power" 
          class="h-6 sm:h-7 w-auto max-w-[140px] object-contain block" 
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
      <div class="space-y-3 text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-4xl">
        <p>
          A five-year progression from hands-on substation commissioning to regional engineering governance. Started in the field commissioning central inverters and battery storage across Latin America, personally delivering Site Acceptance Testing (SAT) for <strong>800+ MW of utility PV</strong> and early commercial/utility BESS installations.
        </p>
        <p>
          Evolved into leading the regional Field Service organization across North LATAM supporting an operating fleet of <strong>2.1+ GW of solar assets</strong> and <strong>~60 MWh of BESS</strong>. Later founded and led the <strong>LATAM Center of Expertise (CoE)</strong>, centralizing Tier-3 root-cause investigations directly with HQ R&amp;D and building regional technical certification programs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-border-light/60 dark:border-border-dark/60 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-accent/10 border border-accent-dark/25 dark:border-accent/25 text-accent-dark dark:text-accent font-medium">800+ MW Commissioned</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-accent/10 border border-accent-dark/25 dark:border-accent/25 text-accent-dark dark:text-accent font-medium">2.1+ GW Fleet Supported</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Tier-3 RCA &amp; CoE</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Central PCS &amp; MV Stations</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">SCOPE: NORTH LATAM &amp; REGIONAL CoE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- PHASE 01: Field Foundation (2008–2020) -->
  <article class="rounded-lg border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark-card overflow-hidden transition-colors hover:border-accent-dark/50 dark:hover:border-accent/40">
    <div class="px-5 sm:px-7 py-3.5 bg-surface-light-muted/70 dark:bg-surface-dark-elevated/80 border-b border-border-light dark:border-border-dark flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-card dark:bg-surface-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark font-mono text-xs font-medium text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">
          PHASE 01
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          2008 — 2020
        </span>
        <span class="opacity-30 font-mono hidden sm:inline">//</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Field Foundation: Solar Asset Mgmt, Oil &amp; Gas Wireline, Telecom &amp; Control Systems
        </h3>
      </div>

      <!-- Compact Multi-Employer Strip -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <img src="/logos/vector.png" alt="Vector Renewables" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain rounded" title="Vector Renewables" />
        <img src="/logos/slb.svg" alt="SLB" class="h-4 w-auto max-w-[46px] object-contain dark:invert" title="SLB (Schlumberger)" />
        <img src="/logos/ypf.png" alt="YPF S.A." class="h-4 w-auto max-w-[42px] object-contain" title="YPF S.A." />
        <img src="/logos/america-movil.svg" alt="América Móvil" class="h-4 w-auto max-w-[60px] object-contain dark:brightness-200" title="América Móvil" />
        <img src="/logos/corpodomotica.svg" alt="Corpodomotica" class="h-4 w-auto max-w-[68px] object-contain" title="Corpodomotica" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
      <div class="space-y-3 text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-4xl">
        <p>
          Before focusing full-time on utility renewables OEM engineering, managed a <strong>400+ MW solar asset portfolio at Vector Renewables</strong>, overseeing SCADA performance, PPA compliance, and plant availability.
        </p>
        <p>
          Earlier field foundation spans cased-hole/open-hole wireline operations in oil &amp; gas across Argentina and Venezuela (<strong>YPF S.A.</strong>, <strong>Schlumberger / SLB</strong>), critical telecom infrastructure (<strong>América Móvil</strong>), and embedded control systems design (<strong>Corpodomotica</strong>). Working in high-consequence field environments built the core discipline: measure directly, respect thermal and electrical boundaries, and design for maintainability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-border-light/60 dark:border-border-dark/60 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">400+ MW SCADA &amp; Asset Mgmt</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Wireline Field Operations</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-light-muted dark:bg-surface-dark-muted text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary">Embedded Electronics</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted">SCOPE: ARGENTINA · VENEZUELA · MEXICO</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

</div>